<title>USA: Dave &amp; Busters credit line doubled.</title>
<headline>Dave &amp; Busters credit line doubled.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dave &amp; Busters Inc said on Thursday that it has closed a $50 million revolving credit facility to finance working capital, general corporate requirements and new store development.</p>
<p>The new facility more than doubles its current facility, the company said.</p>
<p>The transaction was arranged by Chase Securities Inc with Texas Commerce Bank National Association acting as administrative agent for a syndicate of banks.</p>
